---
layout: layouts/feature
stylesheets:
  - page/projects
permalink: /projects.html
title: Projects
description: >
  Explore a selection of my projects, showcasing my skills in software development, problem-solving, and innovation.
heading_description: >
  This page showcases a selection of my projects, including personal, academic, and professional work. Each project 
  highlights my skills in software development, problem-solving, and innovation. For a more comprehensive view of my 
  work, check out my [latest resume](/assets/files/resume.pdf){target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer"}.
---
  <ul class="project-grid timeline-track">
    {%- for project in projects -%}
    <li>
      <section class="project">
        <header>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 640 640"><!--!Font Awesome Free v7.3.1 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free Copyright 2026 Fonticons, Inc.--><path d="M64 144C64 117.5 85.5 96 112 96L208 96C234.5 96 256 117.5 256 144L256 160L384 160L384 144C384 117.5 405.5 96 432 96L528 96C554.5 96 576 117.5 576 144L576 240C576 266.5 554.5 288 528 288L432 288C405.5 288 384 266.5 384 240L384 224L256 224L256 240C256 247.3 254.3 254.3 251.4 260.5L320 352L400 352C426.5 352 448 373.5 448 400L448 496C448 522.5 426.5 544 400 544L304 544C277.5 544 256 522.5 256 496L256 400C256 392.7 257.7 385.7 260.6 379.5L192 288L112 288C85.5 288 64 266.5 64 240L64 144z"/></svg>
          <h3 class="title">{{ project.title }}</h3>
          <ul class="bubble-list">
            {%- for tag in project.tags -%}
            <li>{{tag}}</li>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        </header>
        <p class="prose">{{ project.description }}</p>
        <figure>
          {%- if project.image -%}
          <img src="{{ project.image }}" alt="{{ project.title }}" />
          {%- endif -%}
        </figure>
        <footer>
          {% include "fragments/project-links.njk" %}
        </footer>
      </section>
    </li>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </ul>
